    "22216382-e494-4937-a808-498dbeb69319": {
      "type": "images-with-text-scrolling",
      "blocks": {
        "template--19012768596250__22216382-e494-4937-a808-498dbeb69319-16842550055f70df1e-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/SHF_-_18_-_MACHINERY_14_SQUARE.jpg",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Quality and Sustainability",
            "content": "<p>We firmly believe that healthy animals start with nutritious, wholesome feeds. That's why we meticulously select and grow our grains using sustainable farming practices that prioritize soil health, biodiversity, and long-term environmental sustainability. Our feeds are carefully formulated to provide the ideal balance of essential nutrients, supporting optimal growth, immune function, and overall animal well-being.</p><p><a href=\"/collections/all\" title=\"All products\"><strong>SHOP ALL NOW‎‎ ‎</strong></a><strong>  ► </strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "template--19012768596250__22216382-e494-4937-a808-498dbeb69319-16842550055f70df1e-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/SHF_-_LANDSCAPE_5.jpg",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Certified Organic and Soy-Free",
            "content": "<p>Stone House Grain is proud to be a certified organic animal feed producer. Our feeds bear the stamp of approval from reputable organizations, including the Northeast Organic Farming Association (NOFA), USDA and the Real Organic Project. We also recognize the importance of providing soy-free alternatives to meet the diverse needs of farmers and their livestock, ensuring that our feeds cater to various dietary preferences and restrictions.</p><p><a href=\"/collections/certified-organic-products\" title=\"Certified Organic Products\"><strong>SHOP ORGANIC FEED</strong></a><strong> ‎  ► </strong></p><p><a href=\"/collections/soy-free-products\" title=\"Soy Free Products\"><strong>SHOP SOY-FREE‎‎ FEED</strong></a><strong> ‎  ► </strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "afaf0dc2-a524-4554-9716-508ad8614baf": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/SHF_-_CROPS_9.jpg",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Supporting Local Farms and Communities",
            "content": "<p>As a local business, we are deeply committed to supporting the agricultural community in the Hudson Valley. We work closely with farmers, understanding their unique challenges and goals, to provide tailored solutions that contribute to their success. By growing our own grains and sourcing  locally whenever possible, we foster strong relationships with fellow farmers and strengthen the regional food system.</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/news\" title=\"News\"><strong>READ MORE</strong></a><strong>‎‎ ‎  ► </strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "9834c46f-544b-4120-8eaa-66a03d9309aa": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/SHF_-_21_-_PEOPLE_2_SQUARE.jpg",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "title": "Partners in Your Farm's Success",
            "content": "<p>At Stone House Grain, we see ourselves as more than just a supplier of animal feeds. We consider ourselves partners in your farm's success. Our team of knowledgeable professionals is here to offer guidance, support, and personalized advice to help you navigate the complexities of animal nutrition and sustainable farming practices.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\"><strong>CONTACT US</strong></a><strong>‎‎ ‎  ► </strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
