    "8abbf345-5457-485a-b3ca-65774e73ad30": {
      "type": "image-with-text-overlay",
      "blocks": {
        "template--19012768596250__8abbf345-5457-485a-b3ca-65774e73ad30-1684435999a1c03826-0": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Farmer First Services"
          }
        },
        "template--19012768596250__8abbf345-5457-485a-b3ca-65774e73ad30-1684435999a1c03826-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Custom Feed Blends",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "template--19012768596250__8abbf345-5457-485a-b3ca-65774e73ad30-1684435999a1c03826-2": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>At Stone House Grain, we understand that every livestock operation has unique feeding requirements. That's why we offer custom feed blends, a specialized service where we collaborate closely with farmers to identify their specific livestock needs and craft tailored feed formulations. Our team of experienced nutritionists and consultants combines their in-depth knowledge of animal physiology and nutritional science to design custom blends that optimize performance, enhance growth, and improve overall animal well-being. Partner with us and experience the power of customized nutrition for your livestock's success.</p>"
          }
        },
